From 91e07f893506031790ce616d282a1940160d2595 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ticlext-Altihaf <hi@ticlext.top>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:25:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] feat(types): register sprites as a compute provider

Adds 'sprites' to the provider enum, the standby-resume and sleep-check
sets, the worker runtime path table, the capability matrix, the worker
context label, and the SpritesConfig shape.

Sprites is standby-resume shaped, not snapshot shaped: the checkpoint API
restores into the source sprite, so it cannot back a snapshot-then-fork
contract. supportsSnapshots is therefore false.
